    "q1": "xwOBA is the better INPUT: prior est_woba beat prior actual wOBA at predicting next-year wOBA in all 3 pairs (MAE gaps .0025/.0004/.0020). Real, modest, literature-consistent. Noted for a future cycle that tests est-stats AS Marcel inputs (not tested here).",
